        "answer": {
          "short": "$3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_2 12+\\log_2 6-\\log_2 9&=\\log_2\\left(\\frac{12\\times6}{9}\\right)\\\\&=\\log_2 8\\\\&=3\\end{align*}$$",
