          "short": "$-2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_5 2-\\log_5 50&=\\log_5\\left(\\frac{2}{50}\\right)\\\\&=\\log_5\\left(\\frac{1}{25}\\right)\\\\&=\\log_5(5^{-2})\\\\&=-2\\log_5 5\\\\&=-2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
