          "short": "$-2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_6\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)-\\log_6 12&=\\log_6\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\div12\\right)\\\\&=\\log_6\\left(\\frac{1}{36}\\right)\\\\&=\\log_6(6^{-2})\\\\&=-2\\log_6 6\\\\&=-2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
